---
import Prose from "../components/Prose.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Personal Website"
  description="A bit about who's behind this site."
>
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-hero">
      <p class="text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase">
        About
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-text mt-4 text-4xl leading-tight font-black sm:text-5xl">
        Hi, I'm building this site one project at a time.
      </h1>
    </div>

    <Prose class="mt-8 max-w-prose">
      <p>
        This is placeholder bio copy — swap it out for the real thing whenever
        you're ready. A good starting point: who you are, what kind of work you
        do, and what you're currently focused on.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site itself is one of the projects: an Astro and Tailwind CSS build
        with Alpine.js for the interactive bits, content collections for project
        writeups, and a theme system that respects your OS preference. You can
        read more about how it's put together on the
        <a href="/blog/personal-website">blog</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Feel free to look around the <a href="/projects">projects</a> page for a closer
        look at what's been built, or get in touch — add your contact details and
        links here.
      </p>
    </Prose>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
